      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ISOLATION (5) has returned in fine order, winning both starts off a spell. Came from a similar barrier to score by close to 5m here last week. Big chance to land the hat trick. MY UNCLE STAN (3) drew wider and came from back in the field for a dead heat win at Geelong last start. Should enjoy an economical run from this draw so could make it two on the trot. CLYMENUS NZ (7) may need luck from a wide draw but he looks close to a win after four straight placings. LOUGLE (9) was racing consistently before he was held up when tackling strong company last week. Tougher draw but this is easier. JACCKA EVAN NZ (8) draws for a trail and deserves respect after winning both starts since crossing from NZ, the latest from this row.",
